ears, finished its 13th baktun on December 21, 2012.", "s": 5.572, "e": 19.411}, {"text": "To the Maya, that wasn't an apocalypse; it was simply the odometer rolling over into a brand-new cycle, like New Year's Eve on a massive scale.", "s": 19.531, "e": 29.914}, {"text": "In fact, archaeologists found Mayan stone carvings referencing dates thousands of years past 2012, proving they expected humanity to keep right on going.", "s": 30.034, "e": 42.015}]}